<sp who="#FRE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Frei</hi></speaker> <stage>(im Abgehn).</stage><lb/>
<p>Adies!</p></sp></div><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Vierter Auftritt</hi>.</hi></head><lb/>
<stage><hi rendition="#b">Wirth. Andres.</hi></stage><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <sp who="#AND"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Andres</hi></speaker> <stage>(&#x017F;chrickt auf).</stage><lb/>
<p>Acht? &#x2014; Nun kann der Wilhelm kommen.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIRT"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Wirth</hi></speaker> <stage>(naht &#x017F;ich Andres äng&#x017F;tlich).</stage><lb/>
