<sp who="#BUC"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Buchjäger</hi></speaker> <stage>(noch in der Scene, auf&#x017F;töhnend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Schurke!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ROB"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Robert.</hi></speaker><lb/>
