<sp who="#STE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Stein</hi></speaker> <stage>(&#x017F;pringt wieder auf).</stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#PAST"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Pa&#x017F;tor.</hi></speaker><lb/>
