<sp who="#BAST"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Ba&#x017F;tian</hi></speaker> <stage>(in der Thür).</stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#STE"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Stein.</hi></speaker><lb/>
